RATIONALE
- Current runnerClaimNext_ selects candidates[0] in physical sheet order.
- Including ERROR causes the oldest same-day failed task to be auto-claimed repeatedly, starving later READY tasks.
- On 2026-08-29 this blocked ChatGPT Image task LOCAL_CHATGPT_IMAGE_GOVERNOR_WAKE_20260829_1448_01 behind Flow ERROR rows 348/351/352.
- Central policy already forbids blind retry of identical failures without changed evidence.
- This patch preserves Flow error evidence; no Flow task row/status/content is mutated.
- ERROR can run again only after an explicit reviewed transition to RETRY.

DEPLOYMENT SAFETY
- Existing WEBAPP_TEMPLATE_03 deployment ID is preserved.
- Do not create a new Apps Script project or deployment.
- Apply only to the existing bound Apps Script after exact Script ID/current source readback.
- After apply: runnerHealth version must report 0.3.1-runner-no-error-autoretry; verify READY claim while ERROR rows remain preserved; then regression test runnerComplete/runnerFail.
